  "Line": {
    "DefaultText": "I cannot put an end to your pain, but I can give you a reason for it.\n\n\nI can fill it with meaning and purpose.\n\n\nI can fill the hollowness that afflicts you, which is the real source of your pain.",
    "Text": "我无法结束你的痛苦，但我可以给你一个理由。\\n\\n\\n我可以让它充满意义和目的。\\n\\n\\n我可以填补困扰你的空虚，这才是你痛苦的真正来源。",
    "zh": "我无法结束你的痛苦，但我可以给你一个理由。\\n\\n\\n我可以让它充满意义和目的。\\n\\n\\n我可以填补困扰你的空虚，这才是你痛苦的真正来源。",
    "en": "I cannot put an end to your pain, but I can give you a reason for it.\\n\\n\\nI can fill it with meaning and purpose.\\n\\n\\nI can fill the hollowness that afflicts you, which is the real source of your pain.",
    "ja": "I cannot put an end to your pain, but I can give you a reason for it.\n\n\nI can fill it with meaning and purpose.\n\n\nI can fill the hollowness that afflicts you, which is the real source of your pain."
  },
